<title>JAPAN: HANDBALL-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HANDBALL-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUMAMOTO, Japan 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results at the</p>
<p>men's world handball championships on Saturday:</p>
<p> Russia   25   France    24   (halftime 14-12)</p>
<p> Sweden   31   Hungary   19   (14-7)</p>
</text>
